    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d889">

                <pb facs="1026" n="930" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg930"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.48/1468</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The High Commissioner at Constantinople</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bristol</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic">June 15,
                        1921</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received July 7.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 297</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In my despatch No. 191, of May 10,
                        1921,<anchor n="49" xml:id="d889-f1"/> I communicated to the Department the
                    text of an agreement between the Georgian <pb facs="1027" n="931" xml:id="pg931"
                    /> Soviet Government and the Near East Relief for the distribution of Near East
                    Relief supplies in the Caucasus. I now have the honor to enclose a copy of a
                    statement signed by representatives of the Soviet Armenian Republic recognizing
                    the Near East Relief and giving them certain privileges for their work in that
                    area.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mark L. Bristol</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d889-a1.xml" xpointer="d889-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
